//   - malformed-proof / wallet-disconnect handling lives in the TS layer
//     (pkgs/cli, pkgs/app), not the contract — contracts fail closed by
//     default since an incomplete proof simply can't be generated.
//   - Wave 2: multi-proposal support (proposalId becomes a Map key instead
//     of a single Cell), selective-disclosure audit circuit.
